WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.830 --> 00:00:08.510
In this video we're going to look at how Presslane can improve customer experience by using voice AI.

2
00:00:08.510 --> 00:00:14.110
Voice AI is where the customer calls up your print shop and asks for an update on an order,

3
00:00:14.110 --> 00:00:19.230
which we know happens a lot. And with Presslane, we can do this through AI and automation.

4
00:00:19.230 --> 00:00:23.950
So for the purpose of this demonstration, we're going to pretend we're this client.

5
00:00:23.950 --> 00:00:27.950
And this client has one, two, three, four, five, six orders.

6
00:00:27.950 --> 00:00:30.190
Hello, thank you for calling Standard Print and Stitch. How can I help?

7
00:00:30.190 --> 00:00:33.070
Hi there. I want an update on my orders, please.

8
00:00:33.070 --> 00:00:34.270
Let me check that for you.

9
00:00:34.270 --> 00:00:36.510
I can see six orders: 10, 9, 8, 7, 6 and 5.

10
00:00:36.510 --> 00:00:38.670
The newest, order 10, has a proof waiting for approval.

11
00:00:38.670 --> 00:00:39.950
Which order would you like an update on?

12
00:00:39.950 --> 00:00:42.030
Can you give me an update on order 7, please?

13
00:00:42.030 --> 00:00:42.990
Let me check that for you.

14
00:00:42.990 --> 00:00:44.750
Order 7 is for four Anthem Organic T-shirts.

15
00:00:44.750 --> 00:00:47.870
A proof has been emailed and is waiting for approval. Production cannot start until then.

16
00:00:47.870 --> 00:00:48.910
Is there anything else I can help with?

17
00:00:48.910 --> 00:00:50.510
Just hang on one second.

18
00:00:50.510 --> 00:00:51.550
Of course. Take your time.

19
00:00:51.550 --> 00:00:54.030
So can you give me an update on order 7, please?

20
00:00:54.030 --> 00:00:54.990
Let me check that for you.

21
00:00:54.990 --> 00:00:56.830
Order 7 is for four Anthem Organic T-shirts.

22
00:00:56.830 --> 00:00:58.830
The artwork is approved and it's being scheduled for production.

23
00:00:58.830 --> 00:01:00.110
Is there anything else I can help with?

24
00:01:00.270 --> 00:01:01.310
Just one second, please.

25
00:01:01.310 --> 00:01:02.430
No problem. Take your time.

26
00:01:02.430 --> 00:01:04.750
Can you give me an update on order 7, please?

27
00:01:04.750 --> 00:01:05.550
Let me check that for you.

28
00:01:05.550 --> 00:01:07.070
Order 7 is for four Anthem Organic T-shirts.

29
00:01:07.070 --> 00:01:08.270
It's been scheduled for production.

30
00:01:08.270 --> 00:01:09.470
Is there anything else I can help with?

31
00:01:09.470 --> 00:01:10.830
No, that's great. Thank you very much.

32
00:01:10.830 --> 00:01:11.710
You're welcome.

33
00:01:11.710 --> 00:01:14.110
So as you can see, our system is absolutely live.

34
00:01:14.110 --> 00:01:18.190
As your production team moves this order through the pipeline,

35
00:01:18.190 --> 00:01:20.350
it's updated in real time.

36
00:01:20.350 --> 00:01:24.110
From a client's point of view, they can call up whenever they like, 24/7,

37
00:01:24.110 --> 00:01:26.590
and they'll get the latest information about their order.
